Phase 884: Plant Ecology & Research Admin Modules - 3 new WASM application modules:

1. modules/holarrhena_admin/src/main.c (Holarrhena Connessi Medicinal Administration)
   - Base ID: 2078
   - Manages holarrhena (conessi/kurchi) medicinal bark production
   - Features: tree inventory (16 trees), bark harvest scheduling (rotational), alkaloid profiling (conessine/kurchine), sustainable harvest planning, bark drying/curing records, pharmaceutical grade classification, Ayurvedic formulation tracking, replanting schedule
   - Domain structs: hola_t (id, tree_id, age_years, bark_kg, alkaloid_ppm, grade, dry_method, cure_week, ayurvedic_use, replant_year, active)
   - Functions: hola_init, hola_tree_inventory, hola_bark_harvest, hola_alkaloid_profile, hola_drying, hola_grade, hola_ayurvedic_use, hola_replant
   - Exports: main (demo: tree inventory, bark harvest cycles, alkaloid profiling, drying methods, grading, Ayurvedic use catalog, replanting schedule)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

2. modules/houstonia_admin/src/main.c (Houstonia Bluets Conservation Administration)
   - Base ID: 2079
   - Manages houstonia (bluets/quaker ladies) wildflower conservation
   - Features: population survey (16 sites), habitat mapping (meadow/woodland/wetland/rocky), flower density counts, pollinator observation logs, seed collection records, germination trials, transplant success tracking, threat assessment (invasive competition, habitat loss), conservation priority ranking
   - Domain structs: hous_t (id, site, habitat, flower_density, pollinator_count, seed_count, germ_rate_pct, transplant_ok, threat_level, priority_rank, active)
   - Functions: hous_init, hous_site_survey, hous_habitat_map, hous_pollinator_observe, hous_seed_collect, hous_germination_trial, hous_transplant, hous_threat_assess
   - Exports: main (demo: site surveys, habitat mapping, pollinator counts, seed collection, germination trials, transplants, threat assessment)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

3. modules/hypericum_admin/src/main.c (Hypericum St. John's Wort Administration)
   - Base ID: 2080
   - Manages hypericum (St. John's wort) medicinal herb production
   - Features: field cultivation (16 plots), hypericin/hyperforin content tracking, harvest timing (flowering stage), extract standardization, pharmaceutical grade (antidepressant research), quality control (HPLC fingerprinting), drug interaction documentation, organic certification tracking, clinical trial sample management
   - Domain structs: hyp_t (id, plot, growth_day, hypericin_ppm, hyperforin_ppm, extract_conc, grade, hplc_ok, drug_interact, organic_cert, clinical_batch, active)
   - Functions: hyp_init, hyp_plot_establish, hyp_compound_track, hyp_harvest, hyp_extract_standardize, hyp_quality_control, hyp_drug_interact, hyp_organic_cert, hyp_clinical_batch
   - Exports: main (demo: plot establishment, compound tracking, harvest, extraction, QC, drug interactions, organic cert, clinical batches)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

Build all 3 modules with:
  clang --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -Oz -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wl,--no-entry -Wl,--export=main -o modules/<name>/<name>.wasm modules/<name>/src/main.c

